l":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37775?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/catap","html_url":"https://github.com/catap","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catap/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catap/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catap/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catap/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catap/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catap/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catap/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catap/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catap/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-26T09:32:07Z","updated_at":"2026-09-26T09:32:07Z","body":"Same issue at OpenBSD port as well and I had, temporary, \"fixed\" it by this patch:\n\n```diff\nDisable daemon auto start by default\nhttps://github.com/openai/codex/issues/48050\n\nIndex: codex-rs/features/src/lib.rs\n--- codex-rs/features/src/lib.rs.orig\n+++ codex-rs/features/src/lib.rs\n@@ -941,7 +941,7 @@ pub const FEATURES: &[FeatureSpec] = &[\n         id: Feature::DaemonAutoStart,\n         key: \"daemon_auto_start\",\n         stage: Stage::Stable,\n-        default_enabled: true,\n+        default_enabled: false,\n     },\n     FeatureSpec {\n         id: Feature::TranscriptV2,\n```\n\nwhich disables `daemon_auto_start` by default. At least it makes codex works again for users.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openai/codex/issues/comments/5845067333/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]